WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.565
Today we will compose a simple shared musical phrase. Our work connects with our own

00:00:05.565 --> 00:00:06.280
local community.

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:10.594
Write or say a short call about caring for people or places.

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:14.031
Invent an easy response of similar length.

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:18.543
Practise taking turns as leader and responding group.
